#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0467 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPLB
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when --STDTC is present in a Findings general observation class dataset, where its use is not recommended.
#note "EC-36 SUPP pin, negative twin: a conformant SUPPLB carries only the supplemental-qualifier columns, so the bare STDTC that --STDTC now resolves to is absent and the rule stays quiet. Guards the empty prefix against over-firing."
dataset SUPPLB label="Supplemental Qualifiers for LB"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IDVAR type=Char label="Identifying Variable"
col IDVARVAL type=Char label="Identifying Variable Value"
col QNAM type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QVAL type=Char label="Data Value"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | LBSEQ | 1 | LBREASND | Not done
---
